  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. Builds on the A1/A2 sets with the piece B1 adds: word order when a sentence has two objects. Two full nouns → Dativ before Akkusativ. Two pronouns → Akkusativ before Dativ. One noun + one pronoun → the pronoun always comes first, regardless of its case. Blocks: A Basistraining (case review in longer text) → B Vertiefung (the word-order rule, drilled with reordering and rewriting) → C Sprachbausteine → D Wiederholung. Answers in solutions.md.\n",
